{"ID":"20260213110918-zu7t3og","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"icon":"1f3c0","id":"20260213110918-zu7t3og","tags":"目标检测,YoLo框架","title":"YoLoV8","type":"doc","updated":"20260307134829"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260213110918-yqwhkx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260213110918-yqwhkx1","updated":"20260307134027"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"yoloV8的网络架构和之前的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20260207111650-ljbch8c","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"YoLoV3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的网络架构几乎没啥区别，但是在检测头部分发生了完全不同的操作，这里的检测头部分的输出是很多结果的组成。"}]},{"ID":"20260307134658-fnactq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134658-fnactq9","updated":"20260307134734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"他在这里换成了之前非常出名了解耦头结构，并且抛弃之前的IOU匹配的分配方式。"}]},{"ID":"20260307134809-37j48j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134809-37j48j4","updated":"20260307134829"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 1613px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260307134113-vsesyyd.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1613px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260307134102-emtvata","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260307134102-emtvata","updated":"20260307134831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. yoloV8网络整体架构"}]},{"ID":"20260307134145-q0g0cya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134145-q0g0cya","updated":"20260307134246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个第八版本的原理和之前的几乎相同，也是主干+颈部+头部这三大块网络结构组成的。只不过在这里作者把颈部和头部认为是一种东西，统称为头部。"}]},{"ID":"20260307134247-py2o1pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134247-py2o1pk","updated":"20260307134517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"v8的网络检测头部分发生了比较大的变化，也是这里地方出现了区分。"}]},{"ID":"20260307134526-sszuu08","Type":"NodeCallout","Properties":{"id":"20260307134526-sszuu08","updated":"20260307134623"},"CalloutType":"NOTE","CalloutTitle":"Note","CalloutIcon":"✏️","Children":[{"ID":"20260307134530-lqbyq0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134530-lqbyq0w","updated":"20260307134623"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它很厉害，将几乎全部的视觉任务都集中在了一个网络架构上面进行了实现，无论是目标检测、图像分类、图像分割、目标追踪等等都可以使用该网络架构模型。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260307134113-xtjb8kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134113-xtjb8kc","updated":"20260307134831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);","style":"width: 1629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20260307134004-1ykmch2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1629px;\" parent-style=\"min-width: calc(100% - 0.1em);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20260307134832-q2qgvll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260307134832-q2qgvll","updated":"20260307134832"}}]}